# MadhvaNidhi implementation rule

`MOCKUP_ONLY = false` (authorized full-shell Android port). Full policy: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Scope

- **Write:** `app/**`, freeze docs under `docs/`, mockup freeze marks under `prototypes/**`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, this rule
- **Allowed tooling:** `gradlew`, `adb`, debug install
- UI source of truth = frozen mockups; implement in Android

## Studio (mockup)

- Chrome = landscape screen-size selector + live iframe preview only
- Presets landscape only; custom `width > height`

## Design (Carbon only)

- IBM Carbon tokens/visuals/components only; square corners; `$spacing-05` tile padding
- Android: `Widget.Carbon.*` + `carbon_*` only — Material host OK, no Material3/custom style names in layouts
- No custom components, Desk chrome, or non-Carbon colours/radii/paddings
- Mockup: `cds--*` / `--cds-*` only (moon glyph circle is the sole domain exception)

## Frozen screens (no redesign without new design pass)

- Panchanga — `docs/frozen-panchanga-shell.md`
- User profile — `docs/frozen-user-profile.md`
- Nitya Sandhya — `docs/frozen-nitya-sandhya.md`
- Nitya Japa — `docs/frozen-nitya-japa.md`
- Nitya Puja — `docs/frozen-nitya-puja.md`

## Landscape-only

Never portrait presets or layouts on mockup or device.
